WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:10.200
Chikuwa, wait!

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.240
Chikuwa!

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.750
Chikuwa, what are you doing?

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:35.350
It's a dragon.

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:52.610
Hey, you.

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:56.860
Um, I...

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:04.370
You wanna jump?

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:07.510
Yeah!

00:01:11.890 --> 00:01:17.120
<i>On that one summer day, I was shown this concrete dragon</i>

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:20.970
<i>and became addicted to the fear and excitement of this world of wind and water.</i>

00:01:22.370 --> 00:01:30.210
<i>The boy who climbed to the top of the tallest dragon
was like a hero who vanquished a monster in my eyes.</i>

00:01:32.370 --> 00:01:37.170
Our next diver is from Mizuki Diving Club, Fujitani Youichi!

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:43.650
Undefeated in youth leagues,
he ruled over the other competition.

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:08.230
In first place, Fujitani Youichi with a score of 412.40.

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:12.200
In second place, Tsuji Toshihiko with a score of 381.75.

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:14.230
In third place...

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:22.240
Youichi!

00:02:24.650 --> 00:02:26.750
You were awesome!

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:30.000
You can soar like that too.

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:00.460
See what no one else has ever seen

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:10.980
Off to practice again, Tomoki?

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:12.480
Yeah.

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:15.330
If you love diving so much, why don't you marry it?

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:17.980
Tsukasa, isn't diving scary?

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:21.490
I guess so.

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:22.940
Which is it?

00:04:22.940 --> 00:04:23.970
Tomo.

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:30.570
"Practice," huh?

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:33.750
I really am going to practice!

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:33.750
See ya.

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:43.760
Can I walk home with you on your way to MDC?

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:46.260
Isn't your house in the opposite direction?

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:48.520
It's fine.

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:53.560
So they were showing these popular sweets on TV.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:57.020
And they had these pancakes that looked so good.

00:04:57.570 --> 00:05:02.250
But the person doing the report didn't look like they were enjoying them very much.

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:08.530
So it made me wonder if they looked better than they actually tasted.

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:12.240
They still looked really good to me, though.

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:16.760
<i>Whenever someone hears that I dive,
I always get asked the same question.</i>

00:05:16.760 --> 00:05:18.330
<i>"Aren't you scared?"</i>

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:22.210
<i>I mean, I'm basically jumping off a three-story building.</i>

00:05:23.780 --> 00:05:27.130
<i>What's actually scary is the pain.</i>

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:31.830
<i>That pain of failure that makes you want to throw up.</i>

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:36.970
<i>But you won't know this feeling unless you've dove yourself.</i>

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:40.400
Hey, are you even listening to me?

00:05:40.680 --> 00:05:41.430
Yeah.

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:45.650
Then what do you think is the best topping for pancakes?

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:48.720
Honey?

00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:53.410
No, I mean...

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:55.730
Honey wasn't one of the options.

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:57.920
I knew you weren't listening.

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:00.170
Sorry.

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:18.190
Here's fine.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:21.270
What? I can't watch you dive?

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:23.190
No, you can't.

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:24.690
What? Why not?

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:26.200
No reason.

00:06:28.850 --> 00:06:30.220
<i>It's Youichi!</i>

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:32.450
<i>Wow.</i>

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:34.450
Come on, just let me.

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:36.970
See you later, Miu!

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:57.220
Coach Fujitani, I'm ready!

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:12.780
You need to step into it more.

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:14.320
Your shoulders are too tense.

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:16.620
Keep your toes pointed until you're underwater.

00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:18.600
Don't lose focus.

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:19.620
Yes, sir.

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:25.420
<i>Jumping from a ten-meter height,
hitting the water at 60 kilometers per hour.</i>

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:32.560
<i>A midair performance that lasts a mere 1.4 seconds.</i>

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:38.080
Hey, Tomo!

00:07:39.150 --> 00:07:40.640
Hurry it up, will you?

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:41.650
Yeah, sorry.

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:44.400
Coach Ooshima, I'm ready!

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:58.990
Never hesitate!

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:00.540
Keep moving forward!

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:02.060
Then you can do it!

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:02.790
Yes, sir!

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:07.430
There's Coach Ooshima's classic idealism again.

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:14.800
Ouch. I hit the water hard.

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:16.800
That looks like it hurts, Ryou.

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:20.560
I got a bad feeling halfway through, but it was too late.

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:22.820
Hitting face-first really sucks.

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:25.470
Come on, you can avoid that.

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:28.070
You really took your time up there, Tomo.

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:33.070
When the person in front doesn't jump right away,
it starts to affect everyone else.

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:34.070
Sorry.

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:37.290
It's no big deal. Happens to me sometimes too.

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:39.830
That feeling where you suddenly can't jump.

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:40.710
Right?

00:08:40.710 --> 00:08:45.830
And of course when that happens,
all you can think about are the times you failed.

00:08:47.030 --> 00:08:48.590
Imagination is the enemy!

00:08:48.590 --> 00:08:51.140
What's that, your Coach Ooshima impression?

00:08:51.140 --> 00:08:52.410
That's not even close.

00:08:55.290 --> 00:08:57.660
Another coach quit.

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:59.850
Do you think they're leaving us for another club?

00:08:59.850 --> 00:09:01.000
Maybe.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:03.350
Apparently our club isn't doing so hot.

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:07.860
<i>Mizuki Diving Club.</i>

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:12.260
<i>MDC for short. It's in a pretty bad situation right now.</i>

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:14.240
<i>You'd probably call it a managerial crisis.</i>

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:18.990
<i>To begin with, MDC is run directly by Mizuki,
a major sporting brand.</i>

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:25.600
<i>Wanting to support the few diving athletes in Japan,
as well as the coaches,</i>

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:28.380
<i>Chairman Mizuki founded the club six years ago.</i>

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:30.300
Company Founder     Mizuki Shinnosuke

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:33.070
<i>But he passed away early this year.</i>

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:41.000
<i>After that, it was like the company became very critical of MDC all of a sudden.</i>

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:45.860
But our club will be fine.

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:47.520
How do you know?

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:50.270
Because we have Youichi.

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:55.780
<i>That's right.</i>

00:09:56.660 --> 00:10:00.280
<i>Youichi is our club's bastion of hope.</i>

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:07.540
<i>I mean, his father Fujitani Keisuke is the coach for MDC,
and a former Olympic athlete.</i>

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:11.860
<i>His mother was also the queen of diving.</i>

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:17.330
<i>With parents who have that kind of legacy, Youichi is a true thoroughbred.</i>

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:26.470
As long as Youichi does well, it'll help MDC's image, and the board members won't try to close us down.

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:28.060
Or so I heard.

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:29.440
Who said that?

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:31.290
Youichi said it himself.

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:34.700
But you know, being able to say it is what makes him amazing.

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:56.340
All right.

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:58.600
Let's start by jumping from the side of the pool.

00:10:58.600 --> 00:10:59.590
Okay!

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:06.350
You'll be fine, Tomo! Jump!

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:07.380
Okay.

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:20.110
Sakai, you go next.

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:20.860
Okay!

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:23.480
It's not that different from the one-meter platform.

00:11:23.480 --> 00:11:25.370
It's all the same when you jump.

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:26.630
Okay...

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:33.880
Okay, Oohiro and Maruyama, try the five-meter platform next.

00:11:36.780 --> 00:11:39.450
<i>I don't like being separated from everyone else.</i>

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:42.240
<i>It's lonely and not fun.</i>

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:54.250
He's so cool.

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:16.320
I didn't know you were here, Tomo.

00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:18.260
Yeah.

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:19.950
Did you come alone?

00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:26.040
Even in this rain?

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:28.180
Yeah.

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:30.180
I thought there'd still be practice.

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:31.480
We're getting wet anyway.

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:33.980
Do you like practice?

00:12:34.260 --> 00:12:36.430
I mean, not exactly.

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:40.480
But I want to be able to dive from the same height as everyone else.

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:43.330
You're a weird kid.

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:04.510
Try jumping.

00:13:04.940 --> 00:13:08.320
I can't. I haven't even really been able to do it at a lower level.

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:10.520
Stop giving up before you even try.

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:33.950
Are you opening your eyes?

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:39.960
You have to keep your eyes open and watch the water.

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:42.620
Open my eyes?

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:44.470
Okay.

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:46.470
All right, now go for it.

00:13:47.740 --> 00:13:48.540
Okay!

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:55.310
I have to keep my eyes open.

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:57.230
I won't close them.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:13:59.300
I'll keep my eyes open.

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:04.660
<i>I'm too slow!</i>

00:14:18.950 --> 00:14:19.420
<i>Now!</i>

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:25.310
Yes!

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:29.180
I did it!

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:32.650
Don't think something's impossible.

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:34.680
Everyone has the potential.

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:38.190
That goes for the both of us.

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:45.740
<i>This was the only time Youichi ever stopped to teach me something.</i>

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:53.450
What a scandal!

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:55.950
I just heard about a huge scandal!

00:14:55.950 --> 00:15:00.140
Huh? Probably just those old synchro ladies squabbling, right?

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:03.460
You really should stop eavesdropping, Sacchin.

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:06.930
No, no! It's way crazier than that!

00:15:06.930 --> 00:15:09.970
I'm talking adultery here! Adultery!

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:11.970
Give us the details, then.

00:15:12.350 --> 00:15:16.430
Coach Fujitani is having an affair with a young woman!

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:16.970
No way!

00:15:17.380 --> 00:15:19.030
It's true!

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:24.480
Coach Fujitani told Coach Ooshima to take over today's practice because something urgent came up.

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:28.990
Huh? Where's Sachiya and the Junior High Trio?

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:30.840
Something urgent?

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:34.200
It's hard to imagine Coach Fujitani leaving practice early.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:35.490
It's definitely suspicious.

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:38.380
What could be more important than us?

00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:40.310
I saw it with my own eyes.

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:43.350
A really beautiful woman came to see Coach Fujitani.

00:15:44.030 --> 00:15:46.750
A beautiful woman who's more important than us?

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:48.550
There's no mistake.

00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:50.510
It's an affair.

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:53.390
An affair more important than us.

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:56.640
MDC coach Fujitani Keisuke
spotted with a beautiful woman!
Is he having an affair?!

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:56.640
They were seen getting in a taxi

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:01.270
No way!

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:04.130
Coach Fujitani would never do that!

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:06.330
Yeah, you're right.

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:08.030
What was the woman like?

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:11.260
She had big, jiggly breasts.

00:16:11.260 --> 00:16:14.030
And her butt was really nice too!

00:16:14.370 --> 00:16:19.510
Wait, isn't that probably someone from Mizuki Sports?

00:16:19.510 --> 00:16:21.540
I think I saw her here before.

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:23.540
How could you tell from just that?

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:24.790
An intra-office affair?!

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:29.800
That means Mizuki Sports has finally come to shut us down.

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:30.550
Huh?

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:32.130
The mistress has?

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:34.050
It's not an affair!

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:37.050
Sacchin, do you not get it?

00:16:40.420 --> 00:16:43.060
Do you think he overheard us?

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:44.310
That girl from earlier.

00:16:45.610 --> 00:16:46.810
She your girlfriend?

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:49.220
What's that?!

00:16:49.220 --> 00:16:51.070
It's nothing.

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:52.570
You're having an affair too?

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:55.070
Like we said, it's not an affair.

00:16:55.500 --> 00:16:57.070
It's not like that with her.

00:16:57.070 --> 00:16:58.580
It's not like <i>what</i> with her?

00:17:04.510 --> 00:17:06.330
<i>This is the worst.</i>

00:17:07.740 --> 00:17:09.140
I'm home.

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:13.300
Miu was worried because you didn't return her texts.

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:18.120
Are you even listening?

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:19.300
Yeah.

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:21.060
Why aren't you responding to her?

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:22.560
No reason.

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:24.040
Then just text her back!

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:26.560
I'm not explaining myself to my younger brother.

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:28.060
We're in the same grade!

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:29.820
Shut up, March Baby.

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:32.440
That's not even an insult.

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:37.020
Chikuwa, let's go for a walk.

00:17:50.180 --> 00:17:53.470
I'm in love with you, Tomo.

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:56.630
Can I be your girlfriend?

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:57.750
What?!

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:15.370
<i>Why did I say okay then?</i>

00:18:18.210 --> 00:18:20.030
You've got a girlfriend, Tomo?!

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:21.360
Pull the other one!

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:23.000
Fess up already!

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:25.400
I'm so jealous!

00:18:27.110 --> 00:18:29.270
<i>Maybe I just wanted to show off.</i>

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:32.470
How could you reject her, Sakai?!

00:18:32.470 --> 00:18:33.850
Don't you feel bad for Miu?!

00:18:33.850 --> 00:18:36.050
I can't believe you made a girl cry.

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:37.500
You're disgusting!

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:41.660
<i>Maybe I was just scared.</i>

00:18:42.730 --> 00:18:46.570
<i>But I have no idea what "going out" even means.</i>

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:50.230
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:18:56.570 --> 00:18:58.990
Apparently our club isn't doing so hot.

00:18:59.930 --> 00:19:03.420
<i>I heard they've been in the red these past six years.</i>

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:08.080
<i>Will MDC really be shut down?</i>

00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:10.250
<i>I don't want that to happen.</i>

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:22.680
Miu             Just now

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:22.680
Miu        25 minutes ago

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:26.740
Tomo, off to practice again today?

00:19:26.740 --> 00:19:27.480
Yeah.

00:19:27.480 --> 00:19:29.980
Okay. I'll guess we'll catch you later.

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:31.190
See you.

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:32.480
Bye!

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:33.690
What do you wanna do today?

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:53.470
What is it, Sacchin?

00:19:53.470 --> 00:19:54.880
It's the beautiful woman!

00:20:07.020 --> 00:20:09.100
This won't do.

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:10.840
It's a difficult request.

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:13.150
Yes, it's really too bad.

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:17.560
<i>So she </i>is<i> here to shut us down!</i>

00:20:22.010 --> 00:20:23.910
It's... It's... It's...

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:24.910
This is—

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:25.910
His mistress!

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:25.910
MDC coach Fujitani Keisuke
spotted with a beautiful woman!
Is he having an affair?!

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:27.160
I'm Asaki Kayoko.

00:20:27.550 --> 00:20:30.160
Did you come to shut down our club?

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:33.670
You said something about how it "won't do."

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:36.670
Yes, at this rate it won't.

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:38.930
What?

00:20:39.350 --> 00:20:42.260
Do you think you boys are up for it?

00:20:42.990 --> 00:20:44.930
You wanna make it to the Tokyo Olympics?

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:47.930
I do.

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:53.840
Don't think something's impossible.

00:20:53.840 --> 00:20:55.350
Everyone has the potential.

00:20:56.140 --> 00:20:58.450
That goes for the both of us.

00:20:58.450 --> 00:21:00.860
I want to make it!

00:21:03.100 --> 00:21:04.750
<i>The Tokyo Olympics.</i>

00:21:05.680 --> 00:21:11.120
<i>That was something far off in the distance, almost out of reach for me.</i>

00:21:13.590 --> 00:21:18.610
<i>But strangely, the thought made really excited.</i>
